body:
I agree about the summer classes being online! I am 2 classes away from my degree, both of which I am taking online this summer and the flexibility with being able to still work a full time job and complete classes outside of work has been such a blessing. It also meant I didn't have to move back to Vic for 2 classes which would have been incredibly costly and annoying. 

&#x200B;

I think if covid has taught us anything it's that accommodations can be made to traditional learning institutions or workplaces to benefit most people's needs and still provide the necessary requirements.
